      "content": "i know i should call them but i'm really busy with work all week and the clinic is so far away. i just dont want to bleed out or something lol. is 4.2 really that bad? like could i just take a high dose of a vitamin K supplement tonight just to balance it out so i don't have to worry about it until monday? what dose would be safe for that?",
